- manifest 합계 `173 actors / 549 components / 18 pages`.
- exact class histogram: `StaticMeshActor=91; TextRenderActor=40; NiagaraActor=6; NinjaLive_C=5; MeshSpawnerCPU_LEGACY_C=4; PointLight=3; Rotor1_C=3; DriveExternalSystemsWithSimData_C=2; MovingBall1_C=2; PostProcessVolume=2; ThirdPersonCharacter_C=2; Brush=1; DirectionalLight=1; ExponentialHeightFog=1; GeometryCollectionActor=1; Landscape=1; LandscapeGizmoActiveActor=1; LightBeam_C=1; PawnAndCameraUtility_C=1; Sand_C=1; SkyAtmosphere=1; SkyLight=1; TriggerBox=1; Vehicle_QuadDrone_C=1`.
